      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あっ、にーちゃん！　おーそーいっ！\n待ちくたびれて腹が減っちゃったぞ。\nお詫びとして撫でろっ、ほらほらっ！",
      "jp_sha256": "632eacb1fe893477b5ac7510686452de9588f6a1e6551716e1233aa4d8b9360b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "앗, 오빠! 너～무～늦～어!\n기다리다 지쳐서 배고파졌잖아.\n사과로 쓰다듬어, 자자!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
